<version>1.0.0</version>
<language>TypeScript</language>
Generate only src/pdf.ts.
Export PdfView {goTo(page):void,setZoom(zoom):void,dispose():void} and mountPdf(host,url,initialPage,onPage). Use pdfjs-dist6.4.299 legacy/build/pdf.mjs plus legacy worker URL bundled locally; local /pdfjs/cmaps/, standard_fonts/, wasm/ assets. Disable XFA and automatic prefetch. Render one bounded current page to canvas with selectable TextLayer; expose opening/rendering/error statuses and mark data-rendered=true only after canvas and text finish. Clamp pages to actual document range, zoom to0.5..2, fit to host width, cap device pixel ratio2 and pixel budget16000000. Reject nonfinite/invalid page dimensions; cancel previous render/text work on navigation or zoom, use generation guards against stale async output. dispose invalidates generations, cancels work and destroys loading task. Theme changes must preserve host/page/canvas state through main module integration. PDF HTTP bytes alone do not establish rendering: independent test must inspect nonwhite canvas pixels and expected selectable text. No native iframe plugin dependency, CDN, generated PDF or external script.

This is a manually implemented browser slice described by versioned specifications. Automated PDD regeneration, synchronization and generated story contracts remain unverified. Preserve independent tests; satisfy the unified workspace story without expanding to desktop/harness sessions.
